silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_15_witness_traceability_sections_03_ledger_row_anatomy_decomposition_step_2__step_locate+extract_phase__anchor_+_witness_path_+_witness_line_r a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The anchor column names the section the claim belongs to. The witness_path and witness_line_range columns together constitute the locate phase. The verbatim_quote column is the output of the extract phase. Together, these four columns are the traceability core of the ledger row, corresponding to the first three fields of the witness object: path(w), lines(w), quote(w)." .
